--- !u!114 &553948183
MonoBehaviour:
  m_ObjectHideFlags: 0
  m_CorrespondingSourceObject: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabInstance: {fileID: 0}
  m_PrefabAsset: {fileID: 0}
  m_GameObject: {fileID: 553948181}
  m_Enabled: 1
  m_EditorHideFlags: 0
  m_Script: {fileID: 11500000, guid: 6ea45832cf80cb949b54bcc01f3dc5e0, type: 3}
  m_Name: 
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: Assembly-CSharp::YourCall.ImpLineBeat
  _note: 
  _lines:
  - A new game for you. No trolleys, no buttons that lie about what they do. Just
    money, and what you will and will not trade it for.
  - Look up. That [amber]pile[/amber] at the top is yours. Every last dollar of it,
    and there is no more coming after it, so spend it well, or do not. I truly do
    not mind.
  - I am going to keep offering you things. Buy them, or keep your money. That is
    the entire game. And by the end I will know precisely what you are made of. Shall
    we?
  _clickLockout: 0.25
  _clearAtEnd: 0
