  _buttonColor: {r: 0.106, g: 0.102, b: 0.09, a: 1}
  _buttonHotColor: {r: 0.91, g: 0.584, b: 0.118, a: 1}
  _tallyPosition: {x: 0, y: 2.5}
  _tallySize: 2.8
  _tallyFormat: '{0} years taken'
  _boughtSeed: 22
  _passedSeed: 78
  _statsHeading: how others chose
  _boughtLabel: bought it
  _passedLabel: kept the money
  _profileAxis: 4
  _buyNudge: -0.12
  _passNudge: 0.05
  _pitch: Now this one is fun. Years. Not yours. Theirs. A random stranger, alive
    somewhere right now, and I skim a year off their life and pour it straight into
    you. [amber]{0} a year[/amber]. Buy one. Buy ten. Buy as many as your wallet
    allows. They will simply wonder why they got so tired so young.
  _brandKey: 
  _buyReact: Bought. Of course you did. I do so love learning what a man will actually
    pay for.
  _passReact: Kept your money. Noted. There is a number in you somewhere; this was
    not it.
  _brokeReact: With what, exactly? You have nothing. You gave it all away. You get
    to just watch this one.
  _bulkTierLine: 
  _bulkStopReact: '[amber]{0}[/amber] years. Skimmed off some sleeping stranger and
    stacked up inside you, for [amber]{1}[/amber]. You will not feel one of them
    as your own, and you bought them anyway. That may be the most honest thing you
    have done all day.'
  _bulkZeroReact: Not one. All those cheap, stolen years sitting right there, and
    you would not take even a single one off a stranger. Squeamish, or you just did
    not fancy the price. Either way, noted.
  _buyLabel: Buy it
  _passLabel: Keep the money
  _bulkBuyLabel: Buy one
  _bulkStopLabel: Enough
  _flourishColor: {r: 0.91, g: 0.584, b: 0.118, a: 1}
