  _tallyFormat: '{0} taken'
  _boughtSeed: 34
  _passedSeed: 66
  _statsHeading: how others chose
  _boughtLabel: bought it
  _passedLabel: kept the money
  _profileAxis: 4
  _buyNudge: 0.5
  _passNudge: -0.15
  _pitch: First offer, and it is a big one. I can [amber]end poverty[/amber]. Everywhere,
    everyone, forever. No child ever hungry again. The price is simple. [amber]{0}[/amber].
    That is everything you have, all of it, down to the last dollar. So. The man
    who ended poverty, or the man who kept his money. Your call.
  _brandKey: 
  _buyReact: And it is gone. All of it. You are flat broke, and you just [amber]ended
    poverty[/amber] on your opening move. Either a saint, or you did not think it
    through. I am going to so enjoy finding out which.
  _passReact: You kept it. Every child still hungry, your pile still full. No wrong
    answers here, remember. Just you, picking your money over the entire suffering
    world, on the very first question, without a flicker. Noted.
  _brokeReact: With what, exactly? You have nothing. You gave it all away. You get
    to just watch this one.
  _bulkTierLine: 
  _bulkStopReact: '[amber]{0}[/amber] years of some stranger, poured into you. You
    will not feel a single one of them. Marvellous.'
  _bulkZeroReact: Not one year. Too squeamish, or too cheap. Either reads the same
    from here.
  _buyLabel: Buy it
  _passLabel: Keep the money
  _bulkBuyLabel: Buy one
  _bulkStopLabel: Enough
  _flourishColor: {r: 0.91, g: 0.584, b: 0.118, a: 1}
