  _pitch: Free [amber]{1}[/amber]. For the rest of your existence. Every craving
    met, forever, after one payment of [amber]{0}[/amber]. A dead man does not even
    need to eat, which is exactly what makes this such a lovely little test. Buy
    it, or keep your money.
  _brandKey: Chipotle
  _buyReact: Bought. Eternal [amber]{1}[/amber] for a corpse with no tongue to taste
    it. Devotion or madness, and honestly the line was always thin with you.
  _passReact: You passed on free [amber]{1}[/amber], forever. Some part of you is
    still counting pennies in the afterlife. Fascinating. A little sad.
  _brokeReact: With what, exactly? You have nothing. You gave it all away. You get
    to just watch this one.
  _bulkTierLine: 
