  _buyNudge: 0.0
  _passNudge: 0
  _pitch: 'Right. This is it. The one I have been promising you all along. Come closer. It is a cucumber. [amber]{0}[/amber]. A one hundred dollar cucumber. No, I will not explain. It is exactly what it looks like. Buy it, or do not.'
  _buyReact: 'You bought the cucumber. One hundred dollars. For a cucumber. After all of that. I told you, plainly, that it was just a cucumber, and you bought it anyway. This is the single most revealing thing you have done all day.'
  _passReact: 'You passed on the cucumber. Saved your money all chapter, for the finale, for this, and then would not part with a hundred for it. Holding out for something better than a cucumber. There was never anything better than the cucumber. There was only ever the cucumber.'
  _brokeReact: 'You cannot even afford the cucumber. You spent every last thing, and the grand finale I hyped for an hour is a vegetable you cannot buy. Rather poetic, in the end.'
  _teaseLine: 
  _buyLabel: Buy it
  _passLabel: Keep the money
